== What this file does not change ==

- GitHub will keep displaying "Other" as the repository licence: the majority of the repository
  is reserved, and licensee classifies a repository by a single detected licence. That label is
  accurate - this is a mixed-licence repository, and this file is the map.
- Nothing here grants a patent licence, and no patent is claimed.
- If a licence header contradicts this map, or a file appears in no row, that is a defect worth
  reporting - open an issue. A licensing map that is wrong is worse than none.
